  ==> [[ 0.33 + 0j,  0.91 + 0j, -0.24 + 0j],
       [-0.24 + 0j,  0.33 + 0j,  0.91 + 0j],
       [ 0.91 + 0j, -0.24 + 0j,  0.33 + 0j]
  ```

